{"availability":"available","full":"Harshavardhan-1712/GentleCheck","name":"GentleCheck","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-09T14:09:30Z","updated":"2026-10-10T10:38:13Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://gentle-check.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://gentle-check.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:38.453Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:38.453Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:38.453Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:06:38.453Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Independence for them. Peace of mind for you.","Privacy-first daily care companion for older adults living independently. The parent checks in and completes routines; an authorized family member sees only what the parent consents to share. No sensors, cameras, wearables, GPS, continuous monitoring or AI diagnosis. A missed check-in is not proof of an emergency."],"features":["Parent mode: \"I'm doing okay\" check-in, 6 demo routines (medication, meal, hydration, movement, family call, custom) with complete/snooze, \"I need help\", sharing summary.","Family mode: last check-in, next due + status, routine status, activity timeline, follow-up notifications, consent status, demo clock controls, grace period; add, edit and remove reminders created in family mode while…","Settings: English/Telugu, parent-controlled consent (check-ins, routines, per routine), grace period, demo reset with confirmation.","FastAPI + SQLite (persistent), deterministic escalation (max one per due check-in), consent enforced in backend responses.","The Parent/Family switch is a demo mechanism, not authentication or production authorization. Family-facing API calls are just ?role=family; family-created reminder management is likewise demo-only."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Harshavardhan-1712/GentleCheck/blob/main/R